// Recent sign-ins overview — the first "is it working / what happened" check.
// Shows who signed in, from where, into what app, and whether it worked.
SigninLogs
| where TimeGenerated > ago(2d)
| project TimeGenerated, UserPrincipalName, AppDisplayName, IPAddress, Location, ResultType
| order by TimeGenerated desc
// ResultType 0 = success; 50126 = wrong password; 50140 = "Stay signed in?" interrupt (benign).
